{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22302","headline":"林下闲步寄皇甫庶子 · 白居易","name":"林下闲步寄皇甫庶子","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"扶杖起病初，策马力未任。\n既嬾出门去，亦无客来寻。\n以此遂成闲，闲步绕园林。\n天晓烟景澹，树寒鸟雀深。\n一酌池上酒，数声竹间吟。\n寄言东曹长，当知幽独心。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_22302.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22302","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}